!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/a-refinement-restating-a-field-as-its-supertype-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.7, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2"
  description: """
    Refinement only restricts, so a restated field's type is the inherited type or a type IS-A it. `person` is
    the supertype of `employee`, not a subtype, so `loose` would admit a `lead` that `team` refuses, and a
    `loose` value standing at a `team` position would break the field `team` promises. Every field state is
    unchanged, so a processor comparing only states admits it.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
